OL,3,GNEWSAOnshore wind farm plans move      
OL,4,Aforward                                
OL,6,FPlans for an onshore wind generation   
OL,7,Fstation in the south of the Isle of Man
OL,8,Fare progressing, according to the      
OL,9,Fchairman of Manx Utilities (MU).       
OL,11,FThe proposed Cair Vie development at   
OL,12,FEarystane and Scard forms part of the  
OL,13,Fgovernment's plans to achieve net-zero 
OL,14,Femissions and is expected to generate  
OL,15,Fabout a quarter of the island's        
OL,16,Felectricity needs.                     
OL,18,FThe project remains in the pre-planning
OL,19,Fstage while environmental, ecological  
OL,20,Fand technical assessments are carried  
OL,21,Fout.                                   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
