OL,3,GNEWSAOnshore wind farm plans move      
OL,4,Aforward                                
OL,6,FAnswering a question from Arbory,      
OL,7,FCastletown and Malew MHK Jason         
OL,8,FMoorhouse, MU chairman James Cochrane  
OL,9,Fsaid the board had agreed there were   
OL,10,F"sufficient grounds to continue"       
OL,11,Fdeveloping the proposal.               
